oot / MyBatis-Plus backend work from an approved `*_design.md`. Use when a reviewed design must be decomposed into source-anchored task cards, verification matrices, handoff/evidence requirements, asset consistency checks, and recoverable implementation slices before coding or delegation.\n</description>\n    <location>/Users/sky/.agents/skills/backend-task-pack/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>cli-dev-standard</name>\n    <description>AI 可操控 CLI 开发标准(个人跨项目口径)。任何为软件/工具/守护进程/菜单栏程序做 CLI 开发、命令行化、统一 CLI 入口、新增子命令、设计 --json/退出码/doctor 诊断命令, 或评审 CLI 设计时使用;用户提到&quot;CLI 终端化&quot;、&quot;按标准做 CLI&quot;、&quot;atl/bridge 风格命令面&quot;、 &quot;便于 AI 操控&quot;也触发。含命令面模板、输出与退出码约定、安全护栏、交付验证清单。</description>\n    <location>/Users/sky/.agents/skills/cli-dev-standard/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>fe-tdd-workflow</name>\n    <description>前端测试驱动开发工作流：从需求到可验证代码的完整闭环。强制测试先行（RED-GREEN-REFACTOR）， 确保 80%+ 覆盖率，支持 Vue 组件、Pinia Store、工具函数等多种场景。触发关键词：TDD、 测试先行、单元测试、测试驱动、test first、red green refactor。\n</description>\n    <location>/Users/sky/.agents/skills/fe-tdd-workflow/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>fe-tdd-workflow-init</name>\n    <description>前端测试环境初始化与测试用例自动生成。检测项目测试基础设施（vitest、happy-dom 等）， 未配置则自动安装和创建配置文件，然后为指定模块自动生成测试用例。 触发关键词：init test、初始化测试、生成测试用例、setup vitest、test init。\n</description>\n    <location>/Users/sky/.agents/skills/fe-tdd-workflow-init/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>team-frontend-template</name>\n    <description>Bootstraps new frontend work by cloning the team fe-temp template (Vue 3, Vite, shadcn-vue, Tailwind) instead of ad-hoc scaffolds. Use when the user or a T-shaped engineer asks to create a new frontend project, 起前端工程, 脚手架, clone 模板, 团队前端基线, or when starting greenfield UI work that must align with company baseline.</description>\n    <location>/Users/sky/.agents/skills/fe-temp-skills/team-frontend-template-cursor-skill/skills/team-frontend-template/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>